# Gitru overview

Desktop Git client monorepo. Full map: root `AGENTS.md`.

## Layout

- `apps/desktop` — Tauri + React product (main focus)
- `apps/web` — Next.js marketing site
- `apps/api` — Elysia API (auth, waitlist, etc.)
- `packages/*` — shared TS (`commands`, `ui`, `icon`, `mascot`)
- `crates/*` — shared Rust (`git`, `ipc`, `logger`)

## Hard rules

1. **Never hand-edit** `packages/commands/` — regenerate with `make typegen` after Tauri command changes.
2. **Git parsing/logic lives in Rust** (`crates/git`). Prefer git CLI + parsers; use git2 only for stateful/progress-heavy flows.
3. **`crates/ipc` stays independent of git logic** — repos/sessions/store/clone orchestration, not status/history parsers.
4. Desktop UI calls backend via **`@gitru/commands`**, not raw string `invoke`s.
5. UI primitives from **`@gitru/ui`** (coss). See `.agents/skills/coss/` and https://coss.com/ui/llms.txt.

## Dev

`make setup` · `make dev` · `make typegen` · `make test` · `make format`
